    "Shared opening example is 05:00 Monday before reference weekday shifts. Starting at home is a candidate scenario, not a mandatory NPC schedule. Original household references and financial values retained. One-person accounting household does not imply no relatives.",
    "Calendar year after birthday gives a bounded event interval, not an exact committed event. No training, credential, money or power is automatically granted.",
    "No actor admitted, no new world created, no actual RNG or seed selected. Age variants below are separate proposed new-world test fixtures, never reseeding an existing world."
